D. Gains of Interpretable Model-Based Deep-Learning Design
We next demonstrate the gains of having interpretable modelbased deep-learning design. The fact that GSP-KalmanNet is obtained while preserving the operation of the GSP-EKF gives rise not only to a more understandable operation where one can assign meaning to internal features, but also to concrete operational gains. Here, we explore two of these gains: the ability to extract uncertainty in its estimate, and the capability to generalize from limited data.
